      "content": "Evidence: `prash/cli.py:L631-L636`. - [inferred] Under environment-scoped mode, a SAFE-tier fix is therefore auto-allowed in any namespace not literally named `production`. [1] Evidence: `tests/test_circuit_breaker.py:L10-L54`. - [implemented] The dispatcher logs refused, skipped, needs-approval, errored and executed outcomes with action id, risk tier, mode, decision, result, environment and whether a grant was used. [5]",
